{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_title", "source_sha256": "dfd1cd7d4953810d878a33d01a46492d843254bbe1226f97984b382959617dfe", "ja": "完璧な『私』", "zh": "完美的“我”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82e50710e8321f24a26381bd5713e45a9168c9a9db905609e40b48884077b497", "ja": "最近AIに凝っている律子。仲間との会話で\nAIでなら完璧なアイドルとしての秋月律子\nが見られるかもしれないと考えた律子は、\nプロデューサーにAI律子のライブを提案。\nそんな中、律子にグラビアの仕事がくる。", "zh": "最近迷上AI的律子，在和同伴的交谈中\n想到如果是靠AI，或许就能看到作为完美\n偶像的秋月律子。于是她向制作人\n提议举办AI律子的演出。\n就在这时，律子接到了写真拍摄的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0246a91f4052c5a5408051e9ae9330a45985fee05017c129b757ff4eb62e1bf4", "ja": "（レッスン初日。今日のレッスンは、\n律子がAIを使って組み立てたメニューだ）", "zh": "（练习第一天。今天的练习菜单，是律子用AI制定的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4bcdcb3713af8ff043485cb39820557a8ac4011ee8efc1abd382f446626b015", "ja": "質の高いパフォーマンスを維持するには、スタミナが\n必須よ。そして体力作りに効果的なのは、有酸素運動！", "zh": "想要保持高质量的表演，体力是必不可少的。而有氧运动最有助于锻炼体能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "a5cdefe5f981a88048c1b4ab8b1dcac18e1dc9cc552b82d49a1a00a479210abb", "ja": "それでランニングなんやな。\nよっしゃ！　やったるで～！", "zh": "所以才要跑步啊。\n好嘞！我来跑个痛快——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "839bb80d6cccfd1ba1b46a170ce9a0396224ee7970b1126cff5c30ec30135a81", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。\n今日は日差しが強いわね……。", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……。\n今天的阳光真强烈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "78f627f08638aaf105430f3e827ec302db819cd35677aa09539280afe97880e2", "ja": "は、はい……。\n律子さん、こ、この後のメニューは……？", "zh": "是、是……  \n律子姐，接、接下来的训练项目是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "29b834839af864fc767a8c6abe90745ad602c915464c8ce31473edb503b0f0fd", "ja": "次は筋トレね！　スクワットと腹筋をして、\nそれからダンスの基礎レッスンをする予定よ。", "zh": "接下来是力量训练！要做深蹲和仰卧起坐，\n然后计划进行舞蹈基础训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "9068074a39e38c46066935f8f892f2a417b047cd5f9c850b0821bb10229e87fd", "ja": "盛りだくさんですね～。律子さんのAIは、\nハードなレッスンがお好きなんでしょうか～？", "zh": "内容真丰富呢～律子小姐的AI，是不是很喜欢高强度训练呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "9f2d112c33b158f400ace579bf3566e3155ad4a1b3a015cf4262462c242617c0", "ja": "AI的には、スタミナのなさを私達の弱点と判断したの\nかしら？　ふむ……意外だけど、興味深いわね。", "zh": "站在AI的角度来看，是把体力不足判定为我们的弱点了吗？\n嗯……虽然挺意外的，但很有意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "e4c757625a13b09a92b0317779c67d20db25f30560462a924e16d66bfe45a4a9", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……みんな、お疲れさま……。\nこれで、今日のメニューは終了よ……はぁ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……大家，辛苦了……\n今天的训练菜单就到这里了……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "2d0e34e76db0c0bd5e6f15f69d0da380796357e01cf665a3896d8ef782a50bf6", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。暑いのもあるけど、\nAIのレッスンメニュー、けっこうキツイなぁ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……。虽然天气很热，但AI的训练菜单还真够辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "030c01eeb3dea8eb04c9d202b8faa9afe6227a163aeebeff291d08c370c131f9", "ja": "わ、私も……さっきから、あ、汗が止まらなくて……。\n最後、決めるところも……し、失敗しちゃったし……。", "zh": "我、我也是……刚才开始，汗、汗就流个不停……\n最后该摆好姿势的地方也……失、失败了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "aca0b006b9734f9f1e2b60e1b1610a8ea5bd5cc946c5567d880ce8ec5561e216", "ja": "息が上がってるせいか、動きがぶれちゃったわね。\n律子さんも疲れてるみたいですけど、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "可能是因为气喘得厉害，动作都有些不稳了呢。律子小姐看起来也很累，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "60e938d9d1e5832d2a2855aeb1959529ba051a4ca21c0bc92bbe7483e9d0a701", "ja": "アイドルは体力勝負とは言えど、無理は禁物ですよ～。\n無理と頑張りは違いますからね～。", "zh": "虽说偶像比拼的是体力，但也不能勉强自己哦～  \n勉强和努力可是两回事呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "7219f3dda5324750c9ad8c40c88d7d8bf7f2fb79eb7ff2f506901a255fd39a1c", "ja": "そうね……。これは、私がメニューを作る時、\n気温を考慮するのを忘れてたせいだと思うわ……。", "zh": "是啊……我想，这应该是因为我制定菜单时，忘了考虑气温……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "3f005d7d72e487840d877f4d40acabc1b9165e4c170013d8ac6a1d4735198a18", "ja": "AIに、気温や天候も条件として追加しておかないと。\n……これでよし、と。", "zh": "得把气温和天气也作为条件添加到AI里才行。\n……这样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2f60d5887b2814f3179a95d17b557ea69eb221918e95eec6eca757a487e5f10", "ja": "どうせなら、レッスンもAIが代わりに\nやってくれたらええのにな～。", "zh": "要是连训练也能让AI代替我们做就好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "036d80b2e9542708db85267b27d49472ab7823c08720bde32e42ecdcba1d7183", "ja": "で、でも……。その場合、ステージに立つのは……\n私達じゃなくて、AIなんじゃ……？", "zh": "但、但是……那样的话，站上舞台的……不就不是我们，而是AI了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "2d314bbacfbc3913c73c77722bfdac957e84de8eb89b685f0b39f49e7f12b2c7", "ja": "あら、本当……その場合は、\nAIがアイドルってことになるのかしら……？", "zh": "哎呀，还真是……那种情况下，\n岂不是变成AI才是偶像了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e125e5dc89f973d8704f88e7cd821dd230738757147b2d8633f82a270378cc4", "ja": "いつかは私達アイドルではなく、\nAIがライブをやる日が来るのかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "或许总有一天，不再由我们偶像，而是由AI来举办演唱会吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "ac342486a4d5ac5854c94607063329bb13a1e682495377351f3ef085c690dfb7", "ja": "AIが、私達の代わりに……？\nふむ……。", "zh": "AI代替我们……？\n唔……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1020_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba4728a2d8c1b93a2a63160135f4b58533c7359feb06802290be8f6b71f96320", "ja": "うーん……。私は、アイドルをやってはいるけど、\n自分にものすごく自信があるタイプでもないし……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然我在做偶像，\n但也不是那种对自己特别有自信的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "dfac46e86220c9e4479678e0d23d7fe02b963ed5fd7fcd31a45bd3298e9f5968", "ja": "でも、AIなら……。もしかしたら、理想の姿……\n完璧なアイドルとしての『私』が見られるかも……？", "zh": "但是，如果是AI的话……或许能看到理想的模样……\n作为完美偶像的“我”……也说不定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "b677c096ee64039858ba846317f1cadc59b76c378edee6102eec352bcfab11b3", "ja": "……うん、試してみる価値はありそうね。\nそうと決まれば、さっそく……！", "zh": "……嗯，看来值得试试看呢。\n既然决定了，那就马上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1024_null", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "0b72179feb117225635b256ae57a8d885efadf3be95206b3f585574edce16635", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n今、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f723dbc66ddabb1138ce4f54ee41a186d02349043a66cf09db461a67cc0060c0", "ja": "あ、律子。\n大丈夫だけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，律子。\n没事，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "fc08d4b721f6cec53be1acb3c4139e56de48b8abe4a18f16a02c3c892c9b8d6b", "ja": "次の公演のことなんですけど……。私本人じゃなくて、\nAI秋月律子のライブにする、というのはどうですか？", "zh": "关于下一场公演……我的意思是，不让真正的我登台，而是举办AI秋月律子的演唱会，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0dfa385910c37341d32ec1cbe9c7969d009b302d9ca79b48086123df9c2945d1", "ja": "……？\nAIの律子のライブ？", "zh": "……？\nAI律子的演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1029_p", "source_sha256": "06fa7d519e000f90cbbdad2050543c0768ebfd7259c82ce3414031b6e3f4cfe3", "ja": "それは、流石に無理な話だろ。", "zh": "那实在是强人所难吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "590432424c9a23f6b89a38f961be5f530386eb97a9a9ca7a969cf849719b3aeb", "ja": "まあまあ、そんな渋い反応せず！\nまずは、私の方で、『私』を学習させてみますから。", "zh": "好啦好啦，别露出那么为难的反应嘛！\n首先由我这边来试着让它学习“我”，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "820020abc36ec22f268711eae1df94f9c4ca891e2d040a35ed30b772f274a9dd", "ja": "その後で、実用性があるかどうか見てください。\nそれを踏まえて、改めてご判断いただくってことで。", "zh": "之后请看看有没有实用性。\n在此基础上，再请您重新做出判断。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
