{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1070_009rit", "source_sha256": "5c33dabdf0ea225f46a4f263ecd6d0635a4b70f8e5c3809a6de04dcdfc5db3c0", "ja": "えっ……ダメって、どうしてですか！！？\n歌もダンスも、MCだって完璧なのに！！", "zh": "诶……不行？为什么啊！！？\n歌也好，舞蹈也好，就连主持也都无可挑剔啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1071_p", "source_sha256": "e4209e1a334d64a2c9e9fe91b6af1abfe337652b2b4e03457b3cc019c9c20a0a", "ja": "そんな事言われても……お客さん達は劇場に、\n『秋月律子』本人に会いに来るわけだから。", "zh": "可是，就算你这么说……观众们来剧场，是为了见到『秋月律子』本人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1072_p", "source_sha256": "49cf2788733efa7e0e967389cb3a3d4afea4a0cabf202370bb5cfd9dc78139b7", "ja": "AIがどんなに完璧だったとしても、それが\n律子本人じゃなかったら、意味がないんじゃないか？", "zh": "就算AI再怎么完美，如果那不是\n律子本人的话，不就没有任何意义了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1073_009rit", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1074_p", "source_sha256": "dc5b357602cc89ff4ac5d275a1e33d4543295a2c04ce47ddfaf0b82bfd04ce8a", "ja": "お客さん達が心惹かれているのは、\n律子自身だと思う。たとえ不完全であっても。", "zh": "我想，客人们之所以为之心动，正是因为律子本身。即使并不完美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1075_p", "source_sha256": "65dc545dde8ba85ae1d8a523cbc8602a683dfe474d58eeb0caa305804a090ff4", "ja": "みんな、律子の輝く姿が見たいんだよ。\nそれはもちろん、俺も同じだ。", "zh": "大家都是想看到律子闪闪发光的样子啊。\n当然，我也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1076_009rit", "source_sha256": "b699351ff288e31ae7e8b55bb91108555c73534fcb27a3e0380b0289b520e8c0", "ja": "でも……。それでも私は、\nAIの私より、自分の方が完璧だなんて思えません。", "zh": "但是……即便如此，我也不觉得自己会比那个AI版的我更完美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1077_p", "source_sha256": "7f5d4cac0f31085a58189cb57a0aeb98b3ead755ee98d0ec45457b5f97eec6e3", "ja": "律子……。", "zh": "律子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1078_p", "source_sha256": "05fa5694c0bf941a350a337a82e18c641f8eb7b2b966065b3b2a347dfcfa8cb9", "ja": "……いったん、この話は置いておこう。\nそれより、こっちからもひとつ相談があるんだ。", "zh": "……先不谈这件事了。\n比起那个，我这边也有一件事想跟你商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1079_p", "source_sha256": "ed13f2dff017e2a34d97cfc5066b4c312526922b238b442f5103764d51fa8d1d", "ja": "今回の公演メンバーに、仕事の依頼が来てるんだ。\n雑誌のグラビアの仕事で、衣装はこれだそうだ。", "zh": "这次公演的成员们接到了工作邀请。\n是杂志写真的工作，听说服装就是这套。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1080_009rit", "source_sha256": "4440f5f5b53ddf9ecc39f112697e1db72e70074fa7c0f8afaf037dfd3c4ad97b", "ja": "どれどれ……わ！\nすごく、素敵な衣装ですね。", "zh": "我看看……哇！\n这套服装真是太漂亮了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1081_p", "source_sha256": "010be02b931ba427cf9e0bd278d3ee77c238c01c851287fb33f1ed79c2720d4f", "ja": "うん。律子、グラビアはあまりやりたがらないけど……\n今回の衣装は、絶対似合うと思う。どうだ？", "zh": "嗯。律子虽然不太想拍写真……但我觉得这次的服装绝对很适合她。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1082_009rit", "source_sha256": "0d5db4fa4dd395fc2233a39a59a6b65656e5b69a934d4866dd3f2b68db36aa30", "ja": "……えっと……。\nすこし、考えさせてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "……那个……可以让我考虑一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1083_p", "source_sha256": "9545551ba2d0755e030593b12f408b37af80b2622909d9c6eae8ed6065928fac", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、来週までに返事を\n聞かせてもらえるか？　考えておいてくれ。", "zh": "知道了。那么，下周之前能告诉我你的答复吗？请好好考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1084_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1085_009rit", "source_sha256": "100a42c4952b9b5d766abd967089a963747a1024bed3d7f07113fec7f5678437", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事かぁ……どうしよう……。\nあっ、そうだ！　こんな時こそ、AIに相談じゃない？", "zh": "拍写真的工作啊……怎么办才好呢……\n啊，对了！这种时候就该去问问AI吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1086_009rit", "source_sha256": "c76a1d55815555cc6f45fbfcaaba64046ba0908061bd33c3851dea3f87ed2e0b", "ja": "ねえ、AI律子。私達公演メンバーに、グラビアの\n仕事が来たんだけど、受けた方がいいと思う？", "zh": "那个，AI律子。我们这些公演成员接到了写真拍摄的\n工作，你觉得该接吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1087_009rit", "source_sha256": "569ad7661206961de1ea044daa525887bbc200d2d32ab8992777d7ba688f5f83", "ja": "衣装がね、とっても素敵なの！\nでも、私はその、そういうの得意じゃないから……。", "zh": "服装真的非常漂亮！\n不过，我嘛，这种事不太擅长……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1088_009rit", "source_sha256": "65009b5d40e1b1490c43a23ca0e3e9cfa067b4865d51414ad16ba64f1e113eef", "ja": "【そうね。それは『秋月律子』向きな仕事じゃ\nないわ。絶対に、避けるべきよ】", "zh": "【是啊。那不是适合“秋月律子”的工作。\n绝对应该避开。】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1089_009rit", "source_sha256": "70e746b9736f155ef5de17cbe49ab948bab5729f5ada92269ca0fe81fde95031", "ja": "えっ。で、でも……。", "zh": "咦，可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1090_009rit", "source_sha256": "434471341f08df7ccb3512cdfe6645039158676906b5b3dc78e90bc2ba66a5f1", "ja": "【得意じゃない仕事に労力を払うくらいなら、\n得意な事をやって、高い結果を出すべきでしょう？】", "zh": "【与其在不擅长的工作上花费精力，\n不如做自己擅长的事，取得更好的成果，不是吗？】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1091_009rit", "source_sha256": "749c9c8ccb84d56912de9b36bc72b52a6194380c9631188fd79c19c1e415d3d0", "ja": "そ……それは、そう……\nかも、しれないけど……。", "zh": "那……那也许，确实是这样……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1092_009rit", "source_sha256": "9958c6fe3fd9201db4cc2a78b888049a3c08fb7de4ef3f3e6c3762cd9f250010", "ja": "【苦手なことをやるのは非効率的だし。\nそれに、『秋月律子』のファンも喜ばないと思うわ】", "zh": "【去做自己不擅长的事很没效率。而且，我觉得『秋月律子』的粉丝也不会高兴。】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1094_009rit", "source_sha256": "2d0150bc1f074610560306cdd786073dcbd43e2dba76ddd1abb33c0e36c09855", "ja": "さっきから、知ったようなことばっかり言って……。\nあなたに、私の何が……。", "zh": "从刚才开始就一直说些自以为是的话……你又了解我什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1095_009rit", "source_sha256": "a19f83b7351957334d9b1b298e42330ac7616370850c8edcdff351be0343de2f", "ja": "いいえ！\n私のファンのみんなの、何がわかるのよ！", "zh": "不对！\n我的粉丝们的心情，你又懂什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1096_009rit", "source_sha256": "a51b370a92f4899491e7dc78109be09b83bd6add518381cea9805cdc8aa859d2", "ja": "【律子？】", "zh": "【律子？】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1097_009rit", "source_sha256": "51da76db10115abe449e8b33596b2f610c4cc109e491d7d5e3c7cc03b32ba8ad", "ja": "……決めた。\n『私』は、挑戦するわ。", "zh": "……我决定了。\n“我”要发起挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_156_1099_009rit", "source_sha256": "0a5814196b30f261dcbc757b708854d980caaeb849c41b1e369d18c50c86ef4a", "ja": "今に見てなさい！\n必ず、結果を出してみせるんだから！", "zh": "你就等着看吧！\n我一定会做出成绩给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
